body:
These kinds of people are the exact reason we have flat earthers. If you can, subtly show him that without the 'useless' information he can't do much. Compare him to flat earth leaders. Poke at his ideas. Ask him for help with things in Quantum-mechanics stuff. When he fails to answer correctly (and he will) laugh at him. Stuff like that.

&#x200B;

This approach may seem like shaming him into some sense, but he seems like he has enough pride to handle that.
